@startuml
title 当前实现 UML：一次分代摄取尝试的状态机（2026-07-30）

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #64748B
  ArrowColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  StartColor #475569
  EndColor #475569
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #334155
}

state "已领取\nClaimed" as Claimed
Claimed : entry / 分配单调 generation 和唯一 claim_token
Claimed : entry / 写入 claimed_revision 与 lease_expires_at
Claimed : do / active_generation 保持不变

state "构建分代结果\nBuilding" as Building
Building : do / 从不可变源文件快照加载、切分、转换和编码
Building : do / 按 doc_key + generation 写入不可变 staging 数据
Building : renew [当前 generation/claim_token 匹配且租约未过期] / 延长租约
Building : stale_publish [generation/claim_token 不匹配] / 拒绝发布

state "等待发布\nStaged" as Staged
Staged : entry / Chroma、BM25 和图片分代结果已全部持久化
Staged : do / 结果仍不可见，查询继续读取 active_generation
Staged : stale_publish [generation/claim_token 不匹配] / 拒绝发布

state "租约已过期\nLeaseExpired" as LeaseExpired
LeaseExpired : do / 当前 generation 尚未被接管，但其他 worker 可以领取下一代
LeaseExpired : renew / 拒绝过期续租

state "已发布\nPublished" as Published
Published : entry / CAS 设置 active_generation = generation
Published : entry / 记录 attempt=published 并清空当前领取字段
Published : do / Retrieval 只允许该 active_generation 可见

state "已失败\nFailed" as Failed
Failed : entry / CAS 记录 attempt=failed
Failed : entry / 不改变 active_generation
Failed : do / 部分 staging 数据保持不可见

state "已被围栏\nFenced" as Fenced
Fenced : entry / 新领取递增 generation 并替换当前 claim_token
Fenced : do / 旧 worker 只能写自己的旧 generation
Fenced : stale_write / 允许物理写入旧 generation，但保持不可见
Fenced : stale_publish / CAS 影响 0 行并返回 LostLeaseError

state "可回收\nGarbageCollectable" as GarbageCollectable
GarbageCollectable : do / 确认不是 active 或 claimed generation
GarbageCollectable : do / 发布后同步尽力清理，失败留给未来周期性 GC

[*] --> Claimed : try_claim [无有效领取且需要处理] / 创建本次 attempt
Claimed --> Building : start_processing
Claimed --> LeaseExpired : lease_timeout
Claimed --> Failed : abort [generation/claim_token 仍匹配] / 记录失败

Building --> Staged : stage_complete [所有存储写入成功] / 保存结果清单
Building --> Failed : stage_error [generation/claim_token 仍匹配] / 记录阶段错误
Building --> LeaseExpired : lease_timeout

Staged --> Published : publish [CAS 匹配 generation + claim_token] / 原子切换发布指针
Staged --> Failed : abort [generation/claim_token 仍匹配] / 放弃本代结果
Staged --> Failed : publish_error [非围栏错误] / Pipeline 记录失败
Staged --> LeaseExpired : lease_timeout

LeaseExpired --> Published : publish [所有 staging 已持久化、尚未接管且 CAS 先成功] / 原子切换发布指针
LeaseExpired --> Failed : abort [尚未发生接管且 CAS 先成功] / 记录失败
LeaseExpired --> Fenced : takeover [新 try_claim 先成功] / 创建 generation + 1 与新 claim_token

Published --> GarbageCollectable : superseded [更新一代已经发布]
Failed --> GarbageCollectable : released
Fenced --> GarbageCollectable : takeover_complete [不再是 claimed generation]
GarbageCollectable --> [*] : gc / 精确删除该 generation 的 Chroma、BM25 和图片

note right of Claimed
  try_claim 的另外两条返回路径不会创建 attempt：
  1. active_revision 相同且非 force：already_succeeded
  2. 当前租约有效：in_progress
end note

note bottom of Fenced
  围栏正确性不依赖旧 worker 主动停止。
  generation 进入所有存储 ID，旧结果不能覆盖新结果；
  active_generation 是唯一查询可见性依据。
end note

legend bottom
  状态机主体：一个 (doc_key, generation) 摄取尝试，而不是整个 Pipeline。
  doc_key 标识 normalized_source_path + collection；source_revision 标识快照内容哈希。
  本图只描述当前已落地的分代控制，不与 current-03 的历史 C14 时序图混用。
endlegend

@enduml
